_speech_prob": 0.0007494987221434712}, {"id": 40, "seek": 14996, "start": 149.96, "end": 151.06, "text": " the kingdom of God would come.", "tokens": [50365, 264, 10231, 295, 1265, 576, 808, 13, 50420], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18369172111390128, "compression_ratio": 1.8043478260869565, "no_speech_prob": 0.005219609010964632}, {"id": 41, "seek": 14996, "start": 151.64000000000001, "end": 152.52, "text": " He answered them,", "tokens": [50449, 634, 10103, 552, 11, 50493], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18369172111390128, "compression_ratio": 1.8043478260869565, "no_speech_prob": 0.005219609010964632}, {"id": 42, "seek": 14996, "start": 153.28, "end": 156.64000000000001, "text": " The kingdom of God is not coming with signs to be observed,", "tokens": [50531, 440, 10231, 295, 1265, 307, 406, 1348, 365, 7880, 281, 312, 13095, 11, 50699], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18369172111390128, "compression_ratio": 1.8043478260869565, "no_speech_prob": 0.005219609010964632}, {"id": 43, "seek": 14996, "start": 157.16, "end": 160.54000000000002, "text": " nor will they say, Look, here it is, or there.", "tokens": [50725, 6051, 486, 436, 584, 11, 2053, 11, 510, 309, 307, 11, 420, 456, 13, 50894], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18369172111390128, "compression_ratio": 1.8043478260869565, "no_speech_prob": 0.005219609010964632}, {"id": 44, "seek": 14996, "start": 161.56, "end": 165.66, "text": " For behold, the kingdom of God is in the midst of you.", "tokens": [50945, 1171, 27234, 11, 264, 10231, 295, 1265, 307, 294, 264, 18629, 295, 291, 13, 51150], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18369172111390128, "compression_ratio": 1.8043478260869565, "no_speech_prob": 0.005219609010964632}, {"id": 45, "seek": 14996, "start": 166.38, "end": 167.8, "text": " And he said to the disciples,", "tokens": [51186, 400, 415, 848, 281, 264, 17209, 11, 51257], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18369172111390128, "compression_ratio": 1.8043478260869565, "no_speech_prob": 0.005219609010964632}, {"id": 46, "seek": 14996, "start": 168.74, "end": 173.42000000000002, "text": " The days are coming when you will desire to see one of the days of the Son of Man,", "tokens": [51304, 440, 1708, 366, 1348, 562, 291, 486, 7516, 281, 536, 472, 295, 264, 1708, 295, 264, 5185, 295, 2458, 11, 51538], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18369172111390128, "compression_ratio": 1.8043478260869565, "no_speech_prob": 0.005219609010964632}, {"id": 47, "seek": 14996, "start": 173.64000000000001, "end": 175.20000000000002, "text": " and you will not see it.", "tokens": [51549, 293, 291, 486, 406, 536, 309, 13, 51627], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18369172111390128, "compression_ratio": 1.8043478260869565, "no_speech_prob": 0.005219609010964632}, {"id": 48, "seek": 14996, "start": 175.56, "end": 178.66, "text": " And they will say to you, Look there, or look here.", "tokens": [51645, 400, 436, 486, 584, 281, 291, 11, 2053, 456, 11, 420, 574, 510, 13, 51800], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18369172111390128, "compression_ratio": 1.8043478260869565, "no_speech_prob": 0.005219609010964632}, {"id": 49, "seek": 14996, "start": 178.88, "end": 179.94, "text": " Do not go out.", "tokens": [51811, 1144, 406, 352, 484, 13, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18369172111390128, "compression_ratio": 1.8043478260869565, "no_speech_prob": 0.005219609010964632}, {"id": 50, "seek": 17996, "start": 179.96, "end": 180.84, "text": " Do not go out or follow them.", "tokens": [50365, 1144, 406, 352, 484, 420, 1524, 552, 13, 50409], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16450343813214982, "compression_ratio": 1.7178423236514522, "no_speech_prob": 0.02675369568169117}, {"id": 51, "seek": 17996, "start": 181.84, "end": 186.20000000000002, "text": " For as the lightning flashes and lights up the sky from one side to the other,", "tokens": [50459, 1171, 382, 264, 16589, 39665, 293, 5811, 493, 264, 5443, 490, 472, 1252, 281, 264, 661, 11, 50677], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16450343813214982, "compression_ratio": 1.7178423236514522, "no_speech_prob": 0.02675369568169117}, {"id": 52, "seek": 17996, "start": 186.74, "end": 189.26000000000002, "text": " so will the Son of Man be in his day.", "tokens": [50704, 370, 486, 264, 5185, 295, 2458, 312, 294, 702, 786, 13, 50830], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16450343813214982, "compression_ratio": 1.7178423236514522, "no_speech_prob": 0.02675369568169117}, {"id": 53, "seek": 17996, "start": 190.48000000000002, "end": 195.54000000000002, "text": " But first, he must suffer many things and be rejected by this generation.", "tokens": [50891, 583, 700, 11, 415, 1633, 9753, 867, 721, 293, 312, 15749, 538, 341, 5125, 13, 51144], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16450343813214982, "compression_ratio": 1.7178423236514522, "no_speech_prob": 0.02675369568169117}, {"id": 54, "seek": 17996, "start": 196.54000000000002, "end": 201.28, "text": " Just as it was in the days of Noah, so will it be in the days of the Son of Man.", "tokens": [51194, 1449, 382, 309, 390, 294, 264, 1708, 295, 20895, 11, 370, 486, 309, 312, 294, 264, 1708, 295, 264, 5185, 295, 2458, 13, 51431], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16450343813214982, "compression_ratio": 1.7178423236514522, "no_speech_prob": 0.02675369568169117}, {"id": 55, "seek": 17996, "start": 202.02, "end": 206.14000000000001, "text": " They were eating and drinking and marrying and being given in marriage,", "tokens": [51468, 814, 645, 3936, 293, 7583, 293, 36376, 293, 885, 2212, 294, 7194, 11, 51674], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16450343813214982, "compression_ratio": 1.7178423236514522, "no_speech_prob": 0.02675369568169117}, {"id": 56, "seek": 17996, "start": 206.48000000000002, "end": 209.08, "text": " until the day when Noah entered the ark,", "tokens": [51691, 1826, 264, 786, 562, 20895, 9065, 264, 14408, 11, 51821], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16450343813214982, "compression_ratio": 1.7178423236514522, "no_speech_prob": 0.02675369568169117}, {"id": 57, "seek": 20908, "start": 209.08, "end": 212.16000000000003, "text": " and the flood came and destroyed them all.", "tokens": [50365, 293, 264, 10481, 1361, 293, 8937, 552, 439, 13, 50519], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13103807578652593, "compression_ratio": 1.786610878661088, "no_speech_prob": 0.001443713204935193}, {"id": 58, "seek": 20908, "start": 213.28, "end": 216.4, "text": " Likewise, just as it was in the days of Lot,", "tokens": [50575, 30269, 11, 445, 382, 309, 390, 294, 264, 1708, 295, 20131, 11, 50731], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13103807578652593, "compression_ratio": 1.786610878661088, "no_speech_prob": 0.001443713204935193}, {"id": 59, "seek": 20908, "start": 216.72000000000003, "end": 220.36, "text": " they were eating and drinking, buying and selling, planting and building.", "tokens": [50747, 436, 645, 3936, 293, 7583, 11, 6382, 293, 6511, 11, 20585, 293, 2390, 13, 50929], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13103807578652593, "compression_ratio": 1.786610878661088, "no_speech_prob": 0.001443713204935193}, {"id": 60, "seek": 20908, "start": 220.98000000000002, "end": 223.52, "text": " But on the day when Lot went out from Sodom,", "tokens": [50960, 583, 322, 264, 786, 562, 20131, 1437, 484, 490, 42059, 298, 11, 51087], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13103807578652593, "compression_ratio": 1.786610878661088, "no_speech_prob": 0.001443713204935193}, {"id": 61, "seek": 20908, "start": 223.98000000000002, "end": 227.48000000000002, "text": " fire and sulfur rained from heaven and destroyed them all.", "tokens": [51110, 2610, 293, 33831, 47533, 490, 7162, 293, 8937, 552, 439, 13, 51285], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13103807578652593, "compression_ratio": 1.786610878661088, "no_speech_prob": 0.001443713204935193}, {"id": 62, "seek": 20908, "start": 228.18, "end": 232.0, "text": " So will it be on the day when the Son of Man is revealed.", "tokens": [51320, 407, 486, 309, 312, 322, 264, 786, 562, 264, 5185, 295, 2458, 307, 9599, 13, 51511], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13103807578652593, "compression_ratio": 1.786610878661088, "no_speech_prob": 0.001443713204935193}, {"id": 63, "seek": 20908, "start": 232.66000000000003, "end": 237.26000000000002, "text": " On that day, let the one who is on the housetop with his goods in the house", "tokens": [51544, 1282, 300, 786, 11, 718, 264, 472, 567, 307, 322, 264, 4407, 302, 404, 365, 702, 10179, 294, 264, 1782, 51774], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13103807578652593, "compression_ratio": 1.786610878661088, "no_speech_prob": 0.001443713204935193}, {"id": 64, "seek": 20908, "start": 237.26000000000002, "end": 238.96, "text": " not come down to take them.", "tokens": [51774, 406, 808, 760, 281, 747, 552, 13, 51859], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13103807578652593, "compression_ratio": 1.786610878661088, "no_speech_prob": 0.001443713204935193}, {"id": 65, "seek": 23896, "start": 238.96, "end": 243.9, "text": " And likewise, let the one who is in the field not turn back.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 32407, 11, 718, 264, 472, 567, 307, 294, 264, 2519, 406, 1261, 646, 13, 50612], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.265468124949604, "compression_ratio": 1.7605633802816902, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011332478607073426}, {"id": 66, "seek": 23896, "start": 244.58, "end": 246.04000000000002, "text": " Remember Lot's wife.", "tokens": [50646, 5459, 20131, 311, 3836, 13, 50719], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.265468124949604, "compression_ratio": 1.7605633802816902, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011332478607073426}, {"id": 67, "seek": 23896, "start": 247.42000000000002, "end": 250.64000000000001, "text": " Whoever seeks to preserve his life will lose it,", "tokens": [50788, 24743, 28840, 281, 15665, 702, 993, 486, 3624, 309, 11, 50949], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.265468124949604, "compression_ratio": 1.7605633802816902, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011332478607073426}, {"id": 68, "seek": 23896, "start": 251.02, "end": 253.54000000000002, "text": " but whoever loses his life will keep it.", "tokens": [50968, 457, 11387, 18293, 702, 993, 486, 1066, 309, 13, 51094], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.265468124949604, "compression_ratio": 1.7605633802816902, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011332478607073426}, {"id": 69, "seek": 23896, "start": 254.12, "end": 257.08, "text": " I tell you, in that night there will be two in one bed.", "tokens": [51123, 286, 980, 291, 11, 294, 300, 1818, 456, 486, 312, 732, 294, 472, 2901, 13, 51271], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.265468124949604, "compression_ratio": 1.7605633802816902, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011332478607073426}, {"id": 70, "seek": 23896, "start": 257.52, "end": 259.62, "text": " One will be taken and the other left.", "tokens": [51293, 1485, 486, 312, 2726, 293, 264, 661, 1411, 13, 51398], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.265468124949604, "compression_ratio": 1.7605633802816902, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011332478607073426}, {"id": 71, "seek": 23896, "start": 260.44, "end": 262.56, "text": " There will be two women grinding together.", "tokens": [51439, 821, 486, 312, 732, 2266, 25300, 1214, 13, 51545], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.265468124949604, "compression_ratio": 1.7605633802816902, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011332478607073426}, {"id": 72, "seek": 23896, "start": 263.0, "end": 265.90000000000003, "text": " One will be taken and the other left.", "tokens": [51567, 1485, 486, 312, 2726, 293, 264, 661, 1411, 13, 51712], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.265468124949604, "compression_ratio": 1.7605633802816902, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011332478607073426}, {"id": 73, "seek": 23896, "start": 266.8, "end": 268.02, "text": " And they said to him,", "tokens": [51757, 400, 436, 848, 281, 796, 11, 51818], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.265468124949604, "compression_ratio": 1.7605633802816902, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011332478607073426}, {"id": 74, "seek": 23896, "start": 268.06, "end": 268.94, "text": " Where?", "tokens": [51820, 2305, 30, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.265468124949604, "compression_ratio": 1.7605633802816902, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011332478607073426}, {"id": 75, "seek": 26896, "start": 268.97999999999996, "end": 269.47999999999996, "text": " There, Lord.", "tokens": [50366, 821, 11, 3257, 13, 50391], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3071814898786874, "compression_ratio": 1.0933333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014436348574236035}, {"id": 76, "seek": 26896, "start": 270.28, "end": 271.18, "text": " He said to them,", "tokens": [50431, 634, 848, 281, 552, 11, 50476], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3071814898786874, "compression_ratio": 1.0933333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014436348574236035}, {"id": 77, "seek": 26896, "start": 271.94, "end": 275.47999999999996, "text": " Where the corpse is, there the vultures will gather.", "tokens": [50514, 2305, 264, 30324, 307, 11, 456, 264, 371, 723, 1303, 486, 5448, 13, 50691], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3071814898786874, "compression_ratio": 1.0933333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014436348574236035}], "language": "English"}